@userId = 1

### Register a user
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/users/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "{{name}}",
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}

### Login with that user
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/users/logon
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}

### Logout that user
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/users/logoff

### Get the users Incompleted Tasks
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users/{{userId}}